e of the selected pages contain sufficient public text content to be indexed (minimum 40 characters; password-protected pages are never indexed).'=>'所选页面均没有足够的公开文本内容可供索引（至少 40 个字符；受密码保护的页面永远不会被索引）。','Not configured.'=>'未配置。','Note: To enable page synchronization to the AI backend, define WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_INDEX_API_TOKEN in wp-config.php.'=>'注意：要启用向 AI 后端同步页面，请在 wp-config.php 中定义 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_INDEX_API_TOKEN。','Notification'=>'通知','Only pages you sync here enter the knowledge base. After that, edits are sent automatically; unpublishing, trashing, password-protecting or deleting a page removes it. New pages are never added automatically, and password-protected pages are never indexed.'=>'只有在此处同步的页面才会进入知识库。此后，编辑内容会自动发送；取消发布、移至回收站、设置密码保护或删除页面会将其移除。新页面不会被自动添加，受密码保护的页面也永远不会被索引。','Operations / Supply Chain'=>'运营 / 供应链','Other'=>'其他','Outcome'=>'结果','Owner / Founder'=>'所有者 / 创始人','Page Title'=>'页面标题','Password protected (never indexed)'=>'受密码保护（不会被索引）','Pending'=>'待处理','Permanently delete all leads? This cannot be undone.'=>'要永久删除所有线索吗？此操作无法撤销。','Permanently delete this lead?'=>'要永久删除此线索吗？','Prospective clients requesting consultation'=>'申请咨询的潜在客户','Question'=>'问题','Questions and answers'=>'问题与回答','Questions where the chatbot could not find sufficient evidence and triggered a consultation fallback. Use these topics to expand your Knowledge Base.'=>'聊天机器人未能找到足够依据、因而转为咨询引导的问题。请利用这些主题扩充您的知识库。','Recent Visitor Questions (Privacy-Safe Snippets)'=>'最近的访客问题（隐私安全摘要）','Replace entire backend knowledge base (prune unselected)'=>'替换整个后端知识库（删除未选中的内容）','Reset all conversation counts and recent questions?'=>'要重置所有对话计数和最近的问题吗？','Reset metrics'=>'重置指标','Retry now'=>'立即重试','Sales & Marketing'=>'销售与市场','Sent'=>'已发送','Service'=>'服务','Settings'=>'设置','Settings were not saved: invalid input.'=>'设置未保存：输入无效。','Show less'=>'收起','Show more'=>'显示更多','Show the chat widget on the public site.'=>'在公开网站上显示聊天窗口。','Showing the newest %1$d of %2$d leads. Export CSV includes all of them.'=>'显示 %2$d 条线索中最新的 %1$d 条。导出的 CSV 包含全部线索。','Shown when the chat opens, in the visitor\'s language. Plain text only (HTML is removed). Maximum %d characters. Leave a field empty to restore its default.'=>'打开聊天时以访客的语言显示。仅限纯文本（HTML 会被移除）。最多 %d 个字符。留空则恢复默认值。','Start in the visitor\'s browser language when it is supported; otherwise use the default language.'=>'如果支持访客的浏览器语言，则以该语言开始；否则使用默认语言。','Suggested Action'=>'建议操作','Supported by official website sources'=>'有官方网站来源支持','Sync All Eligible Pages'=>'同步所有符合条件的页面','Sync Selected Pages'=>'同步所选页面','Sync not ready:'=>'同步尚未就绪：','Sync published WordPress pages directly into the AI knowledge base. Content is cleaned and indexed by the AI backend.'=>'将已发布的 WordPress 页面直接同步到 AI 知识库。内容由 AI 后端清理并建立索引。','Synchronization failed: %s'=>'同步失败：%s','Test connection'=>'测试连接','The backend URL and shared secret are read from wp-config.php and are never shown here or sent to browsers.'=>'后端 URL 和共享密钥从 wp-config.php 读取，不会在此处显示，也不会发送到浏览器。','The conversation is kept only in the visitor\'s browser (session storage) and is cleared when the tab is closed. This site stores short-lived rate-limit counters, aggregate counts of questions and the 25 most recent question snippets, from which e-mail addresses, phone numbers, links and long numbers have been removed.'=>'咨询请求','The widget stays hidden until WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL (https) and WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET (32+ characters) are defined in wp-config.php.'=>'在 wp-config.php 中定义 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_BACKEND_URL（https）和 WP_KNOWLEDGE_CHAT_SHARED_SECRET（至少 32 个字符）之前，聊天窗口将保持隐藏。','Threats & Spam Blocked'=>'已拦截的威胁与垃圾信息','Total Conversations'=>'对话总数','Total questions asked by visitors'=>'访客提问总数','Unanswered Question (Redacted)'=>'未回答的问题（已脱敏）','Unexpected response from AI backend.'=>'AI 后端返回了意外的响应。','Unknown action.'=>'未知操作。','View'=>'查看','Visitors can ask questions in a chat assistant. The text of each question is sent to our AI backend service and, together with excerpts of public pages of this website, to Google Gemini to write the answer. The visitor\'s IP address, cookies and identity are not sent; a salted one-way identifier is used for rate limiting.'=>'访客可以在聊天助手中提问。每个问题的文本会发送到我们的 AI 后端服务，并连同本网站公开页面的摘录一起发送给 Google Gemini 以生成回答。不会发送访客的 IP 地址、Cookie 或身份信息；速率限制使用加盐的单向标识符。','Visitors can optionally send a consultation request. The name, e-mail address, company, job title, function and message they enter are stored on this site and e-mailed to the site administrator. The IP address is not stored. Requests are kept until an administrator deletes them, or for the retention period the site owner has set, and can be exported or erased through Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal Data.'=>'访客可以选择发送咨询请求。他们填写的姓名、电子邮箱地址、公司、职位、职能和留言会保存在本网站，并通过电子邮件发送给网站管理员。不会存储 IP 地址。请求会一直保留，直到管理员将其删除或达到网站所有者设定的保留期限，并可通过“工具”→“导出个人数据”和“抹除个人数据”进行导出或抹除。','WP Knowledge Chat'=>'WP Knowledge Chat','WP Knowledge Chat Settings'=>'WP Knowledge Chat 设置','WP Knowledge Chat leads'=>'WP Knowledge Chat 线索','Warning: the backend could not save the knowledge base to disk; the update will be lost when it restarts.'=>'警告：后端无法将知识库保存到磁盘；重启后更新将会丢失。','WhatsApp number (e.g. +6281234567890), email address (e.g. info@inpartnerglobal.com), or an absolute https:// URL on an approved domain: %s.'=>'WhatsApp 号码（例如 +6281234567890）、电子邮箱地址（例如 info@inpartnerglobal.com），或已批准域名上的绝对 https:// URL：%s。','You do not have permission to access this page.'=>'您没有访问此页面的权限。','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'您没有执行此操作的权限。','You do not have permission to manage these settings.'=>'您没有管理这些设置的权限。','the AI backend still has an outdated copy of these pages (an unpublished page may still be answered from). They are retried every few minutes.'=>'AI 后端仍保留这些页面的旧版本（已取消发布的页面仍可能被用于回答）。系统每隔几分钟会重试一次。']];
